#. Tag: title
#: insertfile.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: insertfile.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "inserting files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: insertfile.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kword; has the ability to insert a previously saved &kword; file into the "
"current document. This is especially useful for large documents that have "
"multiple authors."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: insertfile.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To insert a &kword; file into the current document, place the cursor at the "
"desired insertion point of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: insertfile.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Insert</guimenu><guimenuitem>File...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar. You will be given a <link "
"linkend=\"file-dialog\">file selection dialog</link> to select the &kword; "
"file you want to insert."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: insertfile.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have located the &kword; file, click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, and "
"the new &kword; file will be inserted into the current document at the "
"current cursor position."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: insertfile.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kword; will integrate the newly inserted document into the structure of the "
"current document."
msgstr ""
